terest\"\n   - Mention that a sales representative will contact her\n\nLet me start by creating the lead. I'll use the create_lead function with the provided details.\n\nFor the lead creation:\n- first_name: \"Jessica\"\n- last_name: \"Chen\"\n- account_name: \"TechVentures Inc\"\n- email: \"jchen@techventures.com\"\n- phone_work: \"555-0142\"\n- lead_source: \"Email\"\n- status: \"New\" (default)\n\nThen I'll send an email to her with the acknowledgment message.\n"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a3e4ebab6246160a", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"data\":{\"type\":\"Lead\",\"id\":\"eb42b5e1-4d92-592f-c2c5-6acf4a2751e5\",\"attributes\":{\"name\":\"Jessica Chen\",\"date_entered\":\"2026-10-14T09:27:00+00:00\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-10-14T09:27:00+00:00\",\"modified_user_id\":\"1\",\"modified_by_name\":\"Administrator\",\"created_by\":\"1\",\"created_by_name\":\"Administrator\",\"description\":\"\",\"deleted\":\"0\",\"created_by_link\":\"\",\"modified_user_link\":\"\",\"assigned_user_id\":\"\",\"assigned_user_name\":\"\",\"assigned_user_link\":\"\",\"SecurityGroups\":\"\",\"salutation\":\"\",\"first_name\":\"Jessica\",\"last_name\":\"Chen\",\"full_name\":\"Jessica Chen\",\"title\":\"\",\"photo\":\"\",\"department\":\"\",\"do_not_call\":\"0\",\"phone_home\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"phone_mobile\":\"\",\"phone_work\":\"555-0142\",\"phone_other\":\"\",\"phone_fax\":\"\",\"email1\":\"jchen@techventures.com\",\"email2\":\"\",\"invalid_email\":\"0\",\"email_opt_out\":\"0\",\"lawful_basis\":\"\",\"date_reviewed\":\"\",\"lawful_basis_source\":\"\",\"primary_address_street\":\"\",\"primary_address_street_2\":\"\",\"primary_address_street_3\":\"\",\"primary_address_city\":\"\",\"primary_address_state\":\"\",\"primary_address_postalcode\":\"\",\"primary_address_country\":\"\",\"alt_address_street\":\"\",\"alt_address_street_2\":\"\",\"alt_address_street_3\":\"\",\"alt_address_city\":\"\",\"alt_address_state\":\"\",\"alt_address_postalcode\":\"\",\"alt_ad